---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import profilePhoto from '../assets/images/profile.jpg';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <article class="prose-custom">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <div
        class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-8 mb-8"
      >
        <Image
          src={profilePhoto}
          alt="Tim Pepper"
          width={160}
          height={160}
          class="w-32 h-32 sm:w-40 sm:h-40 rounded-full object-cover flex-shrink-0 ring-2 ring-accent-cyan/40"
        />
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-5xl font-display font-bold leading-tight mb-3">
            Tim Pepper
          </h1>
          <p class="text-xl" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">
            Engineering leader building inclusive teams and shipping pragmatic
            software.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-8">
        <a
          href="/posts"
          class="inline-flex items-center font-mono text-sm px-4 py-2 rounded border border-accent-cyan text-accent-cyan hover:bg-accent-cyan hover:text-black transition-colors"
        >
          Read the posts
        </a>
        <a
          href="#connect"
          class="inline-flex items-center font-mono text-sm px-4 py-2 rounded border hover:border-accent-cyan hover:text-accent-cyan transition-colors"
          style="border-color: var(--border);"
        >
          Let's connect
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-accent-cyan to-transparent mb-12 opacity-30"
    >
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-12">
      <div class="rounded border p-4" style="border-color: var(--border);">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs mb-1" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">
          Experience
        </p>
        <p class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">10+ years</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded border p-4" style="border-color: var(--border);">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs mb-1" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">
          Current focus
        </p>
        <p class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">
          Engineering & Delivery Leadership
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded border p-4" style="border-color: var(--border);">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs mb-1" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">
          Community
        </p>
        <p class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">Board Member @ WILD</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        I'm Tim Pepper. I've spent over a decade in software delivery starting
        as a software engineer and most recently working as a director, leading
        commercial and technical delivery for a healthcare platform.
      </p>

      <p>
        I write about leadership, engineering practice, and what it actually
        looks like to lead teams through change.
      </p>

      <h2
        class="text-3xl font-display font-semibold border-l-4 border-accent-cyan pl-4 my-8"
      >
        How I Help Teams
      </h2>

      <p>
        I focus on building inclusive, high-performing teams while delivering
        complex software that actually works. I've led delivery across
        healthcare, retail, and logistics from re-engineering legacy monoliths
        into modern microservices, to scaling eCommerce platforms into
        international markets, to leading technical teams building secure,
        compliance-heavy healthcare integrations.
      </p>

      <p>
        My technical background is broad: Java and Spring Boot,
        JavaScript/TypeScript full-stack, Vue.js, .NET, Kotlin and Swift. I've
        worked primarily in Azure, with time in AWS and Cloudflare. Lately, I've
        been tinkering with AI to see what's actually useful versus what's just
        hype.
      </p>

      <p>
        But the thing I keep coming back to is people. Whether it's coaching
        engineers, running communities of practice, or leading teams through
        restructures and acquisitions, I care most about creating environments
        where people can do their best work and I think that's exactly what
        makes the technical delivery work too.
      </p>

      <h2
        class="text-3xl font-display font-semibold border-l-4 border-accent-cyan pl-4 my-8"
      >
        Community & Inclusion
      </h2>

      <p>
        I'm a big EDI advocate with a focus on gender and LGBTQ+ inclusion. I've
        led diversity and inclusion initiatives across two organisations, been
        an active voice in the Leeds LGBTQIA+ network of networks, and I'm a
        board member for WILD Digital, working to make tech more welcoming and
        accessible. In 2024, I won the Leeds Digital Festival EDI Award and the
        BJSS "Get Involved" Legend Award, recognition I'm genuinely proud of,
        because this work isn't a side project for me; it's central to how I
        lead.
      </p>

      <p>
        I'm also a big video game and music nerd with an MA in philosophy. Love
        some live comedy, you might find me behind the mic or on stage if you're
        lucky.
      </p>

      <h2
        class="text-3xl font-display font-semibold border-l-4 border-accent-cyan pl-4 my-8"
      >
        What You'll Find Here
      </h2>

      <p>
        Pepper Headspace is my attempt to think out loud. I want a place to
        reflect on leadership lessons, share what I'm learning (and unlearning),
        explore technical rabbit holes, and occasionally talk about the weird
        projects and interests that don't fit neatly into a LinkedIn profile.
      </p>

      <p>
        Writing helps me process. If it helps you too whether you're a fellow
        leader navigating consultancy, an engineer thinking about your next
        step, or someone just curious how this all works I'll call that a win.
      </p>

      <h2
        id="connect"
        class="text-3xl font-display font-semibold border-l-4 border-accent-cyan pl-4 my-8"
      >
        Let's Connect
      </h2>

      <p>
        I'd love to hear from you. Whether you want to chat about tech
        leadership, share your own experiences with diversity and inclusion in
        tech, or just say hi, reach out.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="mailto:tim.pepper04@gmail.com"
          class="inline-flex items-center font-mono text-sm px-4 py-2 rounded border border-accent-cyan text-accent-cyan hover:bg-accent-cyan hover:text-black transition-colors"
        >
          Email me
        </a>
        <a
          href="/posts"
          class="inline-flex items-center font-mono text-sm px-4 py-2 rounded border hover:border-accent-cyan hover:text-accent-cyan transition-colors"
          style="border-color: var(--border);"
        >
          Browse posts
        </a>
      </div>

      <ul class="space-y-2 ml-6">
        <li class="flex items-start">
          <span
            ><strong>Email: </strong>
            <a
              href="mailto:tim.pepper04@gmail.com"
              class="underline decoration-accent-cyan decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-cyan transition-colors"
              >tim.pepper04@gmail.com</a
            ></span
          >
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start">
          <span
            ><strong>LinkedIn: </strong>
            <a
              href="https://linkedin.com/in/tim-pepper-214370181/"
              class="underline decoration-accent-cyan decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-cyan transition-colors"
              >Connect with me</a
            ></span
          >
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start">
          <span
            ><strong>GitHub: </strong>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/tpepper0408"
              class="underline decoration-accent-cyan decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-cyan transition-colors"
              >See what I'm building</a
            ></span
          >
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start">
          <span
            ><strong>WILD Digital (Board Member): </strong>
            <a
              href="https://www.wild-digital.tech/"
              class="underline decoration-accent-cyan decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-cyan transition-colors"
              >Learn more about our work at WILD Digital</a
            ></span
          >
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t" style="border-color: var(--border);">
        <p class="text-base" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">
          This site is built with Astro and Tailwind CSS. The code is available
          on GitHub if you're curious about how it works or want to build
          something similar.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
